'''Cat Bros''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was obtainable by clearing [[We're Number One|For the Fans]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.7 Update|Version 2.2.7]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is obtainable by clearing any stage with the following lineup: [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]], and [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Brave Cat]].

