==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Secret Base '''at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
The Cat Bros can be considered a slightly improved [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]], having the same speed, range and knockbacks with DPS just over a level 20+9 Bird Cat. Once Bird Cat's [[True Form]] is unlocked, however, you can safely disregard this unit, because even a level 20+10 Flying Cat renders them obsolete.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump & Melee}}

