==Trivia==
*Cat Bros was formerly unlocked by inputting a [[Serial Codes|Serial Code]] until the feature was removed in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]].
*In the English version, a special [[PONOS Campaigns/You're Number One!|campaign event]] was held from March 21st, 2017 to April 21st, 2017 which would incentivize players to help [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] reach 111,111 followers on their Facebook page. Once the campaign was successful, from May 1, 2017 to May 9, 2017, the event stage [[We're Number One|For the Fans]] went live, which would drop Cat Bros.
*Cat Bros' [[wikipedia:Gashapon|gachapon]] capsule is nearly identical to [[Capsule Cat (Special Cat)|Capsule Cat]]'s.
*Cat Bros' Japanese name, Nyanko 3 Kyōdai ("Cat 3 Brothers") is a reference to the children's song "[[wikipedia:Dango 3 Kyodai|Dango 3 Kyōdai]]" ("Dango 3 Brothers").
*Secret Base's Japanese name, Secret Fortress Nekross, is a reference to the anime ''[[wikipedia:Super Dimension Fortress Macross|Super Dimension Fortress Macross]]''.
*In the Nintendo Switch port, if the save file were to be edited where Cat Bros is forced into its True Form state, it leaves a template slot in its place with placeholder "@" symbols on its name and description. Summoning it will result in spawning an effect before disappearing afterwards.

